{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Residents were surveyed in order to determine which flowers to plant in the new Public Garden. A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> people participated in the survey. Exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/4/e94180815e2f28cc099c042cc1a462f5e7b5d7c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> of those surveyed said that the colour of the flower was important. Exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a2370a3e7c4737d9b84d5546ce132105975dc476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> of those surveyed said that the smell of the flower was important. In total, 753 people said that both the colour and smell were important. How many possible values are there for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579b176143c6b8fe67ec81d7fd6286c5e01b1ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 22 \\quad \\text{(B) } 23 \\quad \\text{(C) } 21 \\quad \\text{(D) } 24 \\quad \\text{(E) } 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"312\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 C